  "Bro was so honest.mp4": {
    "language": "en",
    "duration": 70.9848125,
    "segments": [
      {
        "start": 0.0,
        "end": 2.72,
        "text": "Okay, for $10 billion, would you? Yes."
      },
      {
        "start": 4.72,
        "end": 7.68,
        "text": "Um, I didn't finish the question I'd listen here."
      },
      {
        "start": 8.64,
        "end": 14.8,
        "text": "There was nothing. And I mean nothing that could come out of that little pie hole of yours"
      },
      {
        "start": 14.8,
        "end": 18.72,
        "text": "to make me turn down $10 billion."
      },
      {
        "start": 20.48,
        "end": 23.44,
        "text": "Even if one random person had to die?"
      },
      {
        "start": 23.44,
        "end": 25.12,
        "text": "Yes. The answer is yes."
      },
      {
        "start": 25.84,
        "end": 27.6,
        "text": "Okay, what if it was someone you knew?"
      },
      {
        "start": 27.6,
        "end": 32.16,
        "text": "Yes, take my aunt, take my grandma, hell, you could blow the block up."
      },
      {
        "start": 32.16,
        "end": 37.36,
        "text": "Can you even fathom how much money $10 billion is?"
      },
      {
        "start": 38.0,
        "end": 39.44,
        "text": "Oh, it's just a hypothetical."
      },
      {
        "start": 39.44,
        "end": 43.76,
        "text": "And if it was a reality, I'd be first in line."
      },
      {
        "start": 43.76,
        "end": 47.12,
        "text": "You're talking about human lives for $10 billion."
      },
      {
        "start": 47.12,
        "end": 49.84,
        "text": "Hey, hey, hey, hey. Guess what?"
      },
      {
        "start": 50.4,
        "end": 52.16,
        "text": "I don't want to guess. Don't make me guess."
      },
      {
        "start": 52.16,
        "end": 55.12,
        "text": "Oh, come on. You got to be curious about what I'm going to tell you."
      },
      {
        "start": 55.12,
        "end": 57.12,
        "text": "What?"
      },
      {
        "start": 58.4,
        "end": 62.08,
        "text": "I would have did it for $5 billion?"
      },
      {
        "start": 62.08,
        "end": 64.56,
        "text": "$1,000. What are you?"
      },
      {
        "start": 64.56,
        "end": 65.6,
        "text": "Oh, that's a good question."
      },
      {
        "start": 66.56,
        "end": 70.32,
        "text": "I guess you can call me an entrepreneur."
      }
    ]
  },
